Error [E0355]: `Unsafe` is not a scoped policy
  --> tests/ui/policy_site_bound_authority.jet:1:9
    |
  1 | #Policy(Unsafe)
    |         ^^^^^^
 Why: Authority markers stay attached to the audited operation or declaration; policy scope cannot widen them
 Fix: Use `#Unsafe` at its sound site
